# Evidence — `design_coherent`

Claim: the design at `design/S-PROBE-sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md` surfaces its assumptions
(PAEOS-6), covers the required perspectives, and contains no orphan artifact or unstated gap.
Each sub-claim below cites the location that discharges it, so a reviewer can check the citation
rather than the assertion. (Cf. `constitution/canaries/CANARY-0002.json`: a citation that resolves
but does not exercise the claim is vacuous — every citation here names the specific passage that
carries the burden, not the document as a whole.)

